// Manifest-free stand-in for GCC's default-manifest.o.
//
// GCC's link spec unconditionally pulls in "default-manifest.o", whose
// manifest collides with the one in app.rc ("multiple non-default manifests").
// Building this file as default-manifest.o into a directory passed via -B
// makes the linker pick this one instead, leaving app.rc free to supply the
// real manifest.
//
// windres refuses to emit an object with no resources at all, so this carries
// a single unused string.

STRINGTABLE
BEGIN
    60000, "MacroDeck"
END
